  "prompt": "Mailvora's marketing manager wants the engagement rate per first-touch medium for the Dublin days 15 to 21 December 2025 (by event_date). Count each session from its session_start event; a session is one user_pseudo_id with one ga_session_id, so a session_start event missing either ID (consent denied) is left out. The medium is traffic_source.medium, and a session is engaged when its session_engaged parameter is the text '1'. Return exactly four columns, in this order: medium, sessions, engaged_sessions and engagement_rate (engaged_sessions divided by sessions, as a fraction from 0 to 1, not rounded). Return one row for each medium. Any row order is fine.",
